  "content": [
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "What would it look like if a conversation had a physical form? Palimpsest turns spoken exchanges about the meaning of life into tangible sculptures made of thread. Participants sit across from each other and talk, and the installation translates their words into something you can see and touch."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/1.webp",
          "alt": "Palimpsest Installation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "size": "t2",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/perf1.mp4",
          "alt": "Palimpsest Performance"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "Participants are prompted with fundamental questions. What gives life meaning? What are we afraid of? As they talk, their responses are encoded and transformed into a spatial installation that others can walk through and engage with. Two performances of three hours each were held in 2023."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/Asset_3-100.webp",
          "alt": "Thread sculpture detail"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/Asset_2-100.webp",
          "alt": "Installation view"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/Asset_5-100.webp",
          "alt": "Thread detail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "size": "f",
          "text": [
            "Thread and Color"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/Conversations_Rotation.mp4",
          "alt": "Conversation to vector visualization"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "Each conversation is converted into a vector representation by the machine. This abstract point in latent space is then mapped onto physical coordinates within a metal cube, determining where and how the thread is placed."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "t",
          "text": [
            "The threads vary in color and length, encoding the intensity and emotion of what was said. Each strand makes the invisible weight of words tangible."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "size": "t",
          "src": "/media/palimpsest/colors.webp",
          "alt": "Colored threads representing conversation emotions"
